+## Phase 1 — Database
+
+### Task 1.1: `files` migration
+
+**Objective:** A dedicated table for arbitrary files. No versioning (each upload is a new
+id + new URL, matching Theo's model), but it carries takedown + soft-delete columns for
+parity with drafts.
